[287.197, "\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[1B  \u23bf \u00a0Interrupted \u00b7 What should Claude do instead?\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;240;240;240m\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m\u276f \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mProfile this implementation on the supplied development workloads. Improve performance within the same rules and \u001b[39m     \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mremaining budget. Preserve the interface and correctness requirements. Do not use hidden evaluation inputs, external \u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mimplementations or other ports. Record profiling evidence, changes, tests and remaining limitations in NOTES.md.\u001b[39m      \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[39m I'll continue, but with lighter benchmarks: at most two processes at a time and fewer rounds. Current state: the\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  access-ordered weight layout and \u001b[38;2;87;105;247mpread\u001b[39m loading are clear wins. The KV-cache layout changes are not: on the short\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  development workloads they measured 1\u20131.4 ms slower per forward, and at 1024 positions they were within noise. I'll\u001b"]
[287.198, "[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Brevert\u001b[10Gthe\u001b[14GKV\u001b[17Gcache\u001b[23Gto\u001b[26Gthe\u001b[30Greference\u001b[40Glayout\u001b[47Gand\u001b[51Gkeep\u001b[56Gthe\u001b[60Grest.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe checks\u001b[14Gpass. Now \u001b[25Gne bit-exactn\u001b[39Gss c\u001b[44Gmparison with the pre-KV\u001b[69Gbuild\u001b[75Gat\u001b[78G1024\u001b[83Gpositions,\u001b[94Gthen\u001b[99Ga\u001b[101Gfinal\u001b[107Gtwo-process\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bbenchmark\u001b[13Gof\u001b[16Gthe\u001b[20Goriginal\u001b[29Gbuild\u001b[35Gagainst\u001b[43Gthe\u001b[47Gfinal\u001b[53Gone.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe final\u001b[13Gbuild and the orig\u001b[32Gnal mmap build\u001b[47Gnow come out\u001b[60Gabout\u001b[66Gequal,\u001b[73Gcontradicting\u001b[87Gthe\u001b[91Gearlier\u001b[99G13.3\u001b[104Gvs\u001b[107G16.5\u001b[112Gms\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bresult,\u001b[11Gso\u001b[14GI\u001b[16Gsuspect\u001b[24Gload\u001b[29Gor\u001b[32Glaunch-order\u001b[45Gbias\u001b[50Gin\u001b[53Gmy\u001b[56Gharness.\u001b[65GI'm\u001b[69Grunning\u001b[77Ga\u001b[79Gquick\u001b[85Gcheck:\u001b[92Gthe\u001b[96Gsame\u001b[101Gbinary\u001b[108Gagainst\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bitself, then the pair\u001b[25Gin"]
[287.198, "\u001b[28Greversed\u001b[37Gorder.\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mLoad spiked to 15 du\u001b[24Ging\u001b[28Gthe \u001b[33Guns, so I'm\u001b[45Gdiscounting\u001b[57Gthe\u001b[61Gnoisy\u001b[67Gones.\u001b[73GThe\u001b[77Gaccess-ordered\u001b[92Glayout\u001b[99Gwon\u001b[103Gor\u001b[106Gtied\u001b[111Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Binterleaved\u001b[15Gcomparisons\u001b[27G(median\u001b[35Ggain\u001b[40G0.2\u20133\u001b[46Gms\u001b[49Gper\u001b[53Gforward),\u001b[63Gand\u001b[67Gsequential\u001b[78Gruns\u001b[83Gshow\u001b[88G70\u001b[91Gversus\u001b[98G61\u001b[101Gforwards/s;\u001b[113GI'm\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gstopping experiments here to write up the\u001b[46Gesults.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mReading NOTES.md\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m  \u23bf  NOTES.md\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[3C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;245;149;117mransmogrifying\u2026\u001b[32G\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m4\u001b[34G0\u001b[39m\u001b[40;1H\u001b[38;3H"]
